Package: dvx3
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: DVX3 Project <dvx3@dvx3.local>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libjson-glib-1.0-0, libsodium23, libqt6core6, libqt6gui6, libqt6widgets6, tar
Recommends: zstd
Description: local encrypted backup manager
 DVX3 creates authenticated, compressed backup archives with a Vala engine,
 command-line interface and Qt desktop application.
